    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Tulip Hotel Apartment in Dubai (Bur Dubai), you\u0027ll be within a 5-minute drive of Dubai Cruise Terminal and Dubai World Trade Centre.  This hotel is 0.5 mi (0.8 km) from BurJuman Mall and 3.8 mi (6 km) from Gold Souk."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 154 guestrooms, featuring kitchens with refrigerators and stovetops. Flat-screen televisions with cable programming provide entertainment, while complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Enjoy a range of recreational amenities, including a health club, an outdoor pool, and a sauna. This hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access and concierge services.Featured amenities include a 24-hour business center, complimentary newspapers in the lobby, and dry cleaning/laundry services. A roundtrip airport shuttle is provided for a surcharge (available 24 hours), and free self parking is available onsite."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EBurJuman Mall - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Meena Bazaar - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Textile Souk - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Dubai Museum - 1.5 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Dubai Creek - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Grand Mosque - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Ali bin Abi Talib Mosque - 1.7 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hindi Lane - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Al Seef - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sheikh Saeed Al Maktoum House - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E The Dubai Heritage Village - 2.3 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Deira Spice Souq - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Spice Souk - 2.7 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Creek Park - 2.8 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Gold Souk - 2.9 km / 1.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EDubai Intl. Airport (DXB) - 10.9 km / 6.8 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Sharjah (SHJ-Sharjah Intl.) - 33.3 km / 20.7 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Al Maktoum Intl. Airport (DWC) - 59.4 km / 36.9 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Tulip Hotel Apartment is Dubai Intl. Airport (DXB). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": null
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Enjoy a meal at Tulip Cafe or snacks in the coffee shop/cafe. The hotel also offers room service (during limited hours). Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 7:00 AM to 11:00 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
